referenceFunction.generalComment:
The raw materials are mixed in a certain ratio, transported to the packing installation and packed. No direct process emissions are taken into account as they play a subordinate role compared to the emissions of the raw material production (e.g. drying of silica sand) and because no data are available. For inventoring the infrastructure, a yearly production amount of 150'000 tons of an Austrian producer is assumed. The lifespan of the machines is assumed to be 20 years.;
Synonyms: compo; 
UUID: af69dc4a-2bc9-3831-9cd2-74239009bfb6
